    <div class="study-intro"><div><span class="eyebrow">The first draft / 07 September 2026</span><h1>A family of products.<br /><em>A website to match.</em></h1></div><p>Two ways to bring Plate 89 to the web. A complete, connected journey through the products, the places they serve and the thinking behind them.</p></div>
    <div class="direction-grid">
      <article class="direction-card"><a class="direction-preview-link" href={href('field-guide')} aria-label="Explore direction A, Field guide"><div class="direction-preview"><div class="preview-nav"><img src={art.logoBlue} alt="" /><span>Products Sites About</span></div><div class="preview-body"><span>SIMPLE CONTROL. YOUR WAY.</span><h2>Your corner.<br /><em>Your control.</em></h2><span class="mini-button">Meet the family ↗</span><div class="mini-app"><b>North cottage</b><span>YOUR SITE / OVERVIEW</span><strong>78<small>%</small></strong><span>Battery reserve · Sample data</span><div>2.4 kW &nbsp; 18.4 °C</div></div></div></div></a><div class="direction-meta"><span class="eyebrow">Direction A / Field guide <span class="recommended">Recommended</span></span><h3>Grounded. Clear. Welcoming.</h3><p>Paper, bridge blue and tactile product moments. Lead with the owner’s site, then make room for the engineering.</p><a class="button" href={href('field-guide')}>Explore the complete draft <span>↗</span></a></div></article>
      <article class="direction-card dark"><a class="direction-preview-link" href={href('instrument')} aria-label="Explore direction B, Instrument"><div class="direction-preview"><div class="preview-nav"><img src={art.logoWhite} alt="" /><span>Products Sites About</span></div><div class="preview-body"><span>ORIGIN89 / SITE CONTROL SYSTEM</span><h2>At your site.<br /><em>In your hands.</em></h2><span class="mini-button">Explore the system ↗</span><img class="preview-hardware" src={art.controller} alt="" /></div></div></a><div class="direction-meta"><span class="eyebrow">Direction B / Instrument <span>Technical emphasis</span></span><h3>Precise. Tactile. Capable.</h3><p>Ink, chalk and a hardware-led opening. A stronger equipment-room feel, with pale surfaces around Buddy and the app.</p><a class="button" href={href('instrument')}>Explore the complete draft <span>↗</span></a></div></article>
