    <div class="study-notes"><span class="eyebrow">What you can review now</span><h2 style="margin-top:16px">Real assets. A working first draft.</h2><ul><li>Both directions include the full navigation and page family. Use A / B in the review strip to compare the same page.</li><li>Official Plate 89 SVGs, bundled Inter Tight and IBM Plex Mono, and renders from the editable brand library.</li><li>Try the missing-reading state on the Offgrid page, filter equipment categories, inspect the Controller board and open the practical questions.</li><li>Product status stays visible. App readings, interface layouts and assistant copy are illustrative. There are no invented prices, shipping dates or customer testimonials.</li><li>The current Controller render retains its earlier enclosure artwork. Update that artwork in its Blender source after the website direction is selected.</li><li>All three site pages use the existing forest asset for this draft. A later photography pass should give maple and industrial pages their own specific settings.</li><li>This study uses a separate local build. Publishing, hardware rebranding and a connected lead form are separate release work.</li><li>Contact opens an email draft for the visitor to review and send. KM43 stays in the technical documentation.</li></ul></div>
